-- Parser cases for syntax the Cores don't parse yet, in broken.talk's format.
-- Only `bun tools/grammar/check.ts` reads this file, so the Cores' fixture
-- tests don't fail on it. Each case moves into broken.talk, or its source
-- into a sketch, when both Cores parse it.
--
-- Named Shapes (ADR 0168, #2104): #2105 (TS) and #2106 (Zig) move these.
-- case: named Shapes with every Shape Term
-- expect: parses
shape Line is {sku: text, qty: number}
private shape Money is GBP or USD
shape Invoice is {
  type: text,
  amount: Money,
  speed: m/s,
  span: a quantity of length,
  owner: object of Account,
  ref: optional text,
  note: (optional text),
  lines: list of Line,
  tags: list of (text or number),
  "made at": civil date,
  ...
}
shape Anything is {...}
shape Nested is list of list of object
on file msg
  if msg is an Invoice then put check(msg, Invoice) into inv
  if msg is not a Line then say "no"
end file
-- case: `shape` is a Name outside a declaration
-- expect: parses
on t shape
  put shape into a
end t
-- case: a text literal is not a Shape Term (left for literal-value Shapes)
-- expect: unexpected token at 1:24
shape State is text or "draft"
-- case: `...` comes last in a Shape Map
-- expect: unexpected token at 1:16
shape S is {..., a: text}
-- case: a Shape declaration needs `is`
-- expect: unexpected token at 1:9
shape S = {a: text}
-- case: `object of` takes only a Name
-- expect: unexpected token at 1:22
shape S is object of {a: text}
